nts_url":"https://api.github.com/users/icbaker/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"unlabeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2020-03-23T10:33:02Z","label":{"name":"needs triage","color":"5ce8b7"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/603521573","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/7122#issuecomment-603521573","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/7122","id":603521573,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDYwMzUyMTU3Mw==","user":{"login":"warren-bank","id":6810270,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MTAyNzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6810270?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/warren-bank","html_url":"https://github.com/warren-bank","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warren-bank/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warren-bank/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warren-bank/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warren-bank/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warren-bank/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warren-bank/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warren-bank/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warren-bank/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warren-bank/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-03-24T21:46:18Z","updated_at":"2020-03-24T21:46:18Z","body":"I agree; I couldn't find any formal spec anywhere either.\r\n\r\nSince it is loosely specified, .srt files in the wild appear to feel free to ignore unwanted fields. For example, [here](https://github.com/cpetersen/srt/issues/24) is a similar discussion about whether or not the MILLISECONDS field could be made optional.. and that project concluded: \"why not?\".\r\n\r\nI would propose that while you're touching this decoder:\r\n* optional fields: hours, milliseconds\r\n* required fields: minutes, seconds\r\n* updated regex:\r\n  ```java\r\n    private static final String SUBRIP_TIMECODE = \"(?:(\\\\d+):)?(\\\\d+):(\\\\d+)(?:,(\\\\d+))?\";\r\n  ```","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/603521573/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"warren-bank","id":6810270,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MTAyNzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6810270?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/warren-bank","html_url":"https://github.com/warren-bank","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warren-bank/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warren-bank/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warren-bank/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warren-bank/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warren-bank/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warren-bank/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warren-bank/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warren-bank/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warren-bank/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/603543743","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/7122#issuecomment-603543743","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/7122","id":603543743,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDYwMzU0Mzc0Mw==","user":{"login":"warren-bank","id":6810270,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MTAyNzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6810270?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/warren-bank","html_url":"https://github.com/warren-bank","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warren-bank/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warren-bank/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warren-bank/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warren-bank/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warren-bank/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warren-bank/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warren-bank/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warren-bank/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warren-bank/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2020-03-24T22:46:45Z","updated_at":"2020-03-25T01:48:25Z","body":"[__full example:__](https://repl.it/@WarrenBank/ExoPlayer-SubripDecoder)\r\n\r\n```java\r\n// https://repl.it/@WarrenBank/ExoPlayer-SubripDecoder\r\n\r\nimport java.util.regex.Matcher;\r\nimport java.util.regex.Pattern;\r\n\r\nclass Main {\r\n  public static void main(String[] args) {\r\n    run_test(\"00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000\");\r\n    run_test(\"   00:00,000 -->    00:01,000\");\r\n    run_test(\"   00:00     -->    00:01    \");\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  private static final String SUBRIP_TIMECODE = \"(?:(\\\\d+):)?(\\\\d+):(\\\\d+)(?:,(\\\\d+))?\";\r\n  private static final Pattern SUBRIP_TIMING_LINE = Pattern.compile(\"\\\\s*(\" + SUBRIP_TIMECODE + \")\\\\s*-->\\\\s*(\" + SUBRIP_TIMECODE + \")\\\\s*\");\r\n\r\n  private static void run_test(String currentLine) {\r\n    Matcher matcher = SUBRIP_TIMING_LINE.matcher(currentLine);\r\n    if (matcher.matches()) {\r\n      long start = parseTimecode(matcher, /* groupOffset= */ 1);\r\n      long end   = parseTimecode(matcher, /* groupOffset= */ 6);\r\n\r\n      System.out.println(\"start: \" + start);\r\n      System.out.println(\"end:   \" + end);\r\n    }\r\n    else {\r\n      System.out.println(\"no match\");\r\n    }\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  private static long parseTimecode(Matcher matcher, int groupOffset) {\r\n    long timestampMs = 0;\r\n    String groupVal;\r\n\r\n    // HOURS field is optional\r\n    groupVal = matcher.group(groupOffset + 1);\r\n    if (groupVal != null)\r\n      timestampMs += Long.parseLong(groupVal) * 60 * 60 * 1000;\r\n\r\n    // MINUTES field is required\r\n    groupVal = matcher.group(groupOffset + 2);\r\n    if (groupVal != null)\r\n      timestampMs += Long.parseLong(groupVal) * 60 * 1000;\r\n\r\n    // SECONDS field is required\r\n    groupVal = matcher.group(groupOffset + 3);\r\n    if (groupVal != null)\r\n      timestampMs += Long.parseLong(groupVal) * 1000;\r\n\r\n    // MILLISECONDS field is optional\r\n    groupVal = matcher.group(groupOffset + 4);\r\n    if (groupVal != null)\r\n      timestampMs += Long.parseLong(groupVal);\r\n\r\n    // convert timecode from MILLISECONDS to MICROSECONDS\r\n    return timestampMs * 1000;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\n_output (stdout):_\r\n\r\n```text\r\nstart: 0\r\nend:   1000000\r\nstart: 0\r\nend:   1000000\r\nstart: 0\r\nend:   1000000\r\n```\r\n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/603543743/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"warren-bank","id":6810270,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY4MTAyNzA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/6810270?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/warren-bank","html_url":"https://github.com/warren-bank","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warren-bank/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warren-bank/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/warren-bank/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://ap